            <h3>Fields of Inquiry</h3>
          </summary>
          <div class="panel-content">
            <ul>
                  <li>The transmission of knowledge across generations</li>
                <li>The preservation and alteration of historical records</li>
                <li>The distinction between oral and written traditions</li>
                <li>The role of institutions in shaping historical narratives</li>
                <li>The loss, distortion, or suppression of knowledge</li>
