            <ul>
              <li>How reliable are transmitted records over long time scales? </li>
                <li>  What mechanisms distort historical information?</li>
                <li>  What knowledge has been lost, and why?</li>
                 <li> Are there consistent patterns in suppressed knowledge?</li>
                <li> How do translation and interpretation alter meaning?</li> 
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>

